ripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"404: This page could not be found.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"style\\\":{\\\"fontFamily\\\":\\\"system-ui,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,\\\\\\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"100vh\\\",\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"display\\\":\\\"flex\\\",\\\"flexDirection\\\":\\\"column\\\",\\\"alignItems\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"justifyContent\\\":\\\"center\\\"},\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"body{color:#000;background:#fff;margin:0}.next-error-h1{border-right:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.3)}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#fff;background:#000}.next-error-h1{border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)}}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h1\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"next-error-h1\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"display\\\":\\\"inline-block\\\",\\\"margin\\\":\\\"0 20px 0 0\\\",\\\"padding\\\":\\\"0 23px 0 0\\\",\\\"fontSize\\\":24,\\\"fontWeight\\\":500,\\\"verticalAlign\\\":\\\"top\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"49px\\\"},\\\"children\\\":404}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"style\\\":{\\\"display\\\":\\\"inline-block\\\"},\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"style\\\":{\\\"fontSize\\\":14,\\\"fontWeight\\\":400,\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"49px\\\",\\\"margin\\\":0},\\\"children\\\":\\\"This page could not be found.\\\"}]}]]}]}]],[]],\\\"forbidden\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"unauthorized\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]}]}]]}],\\\"p\\\":false,\\\"v\\\":null},\\\"c\\\":\\\"$Q8\\\"},\\\"h\\\":{\\\"r\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L11\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L12\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L14\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$e\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.Metadata\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L15\\\"}]}],null]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"next-size-adjust\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"\\\"}]]}],\\\"p\\\":false,\\\"v\\\":null}},\\\"m\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"G\\\":[\\\"$16\\\",[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1pw566iu1r5qg.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]],\\\"S\\\":true,\\\"r\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"s\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"l\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"d\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"c9R65ec3spqX_R0_87Nhd\\\"}\\n:HL[\\\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dzyxm0rhg/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1786859644/surgical-showroom_d0gdmo.png\\\",\\\"image\\\"]\\n9:C\\n17:T1544,\\u003cp\\u003eLet us start with something most web developers will never tell you:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eNot every business needs a website.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf most of your customers already know you, find you through referrals and come back because they trust you, a website may not be the thing holding your business back.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eBut there is another kind of business.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe kind where a potential customer hears your name, opens their phone, searches for you and starts checking.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThat search happens before the phone call.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eSometimes before you even know the buyer exists.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eThe five-minute background check\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA serious buyer rarely wants to be the first person to trust you.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey check.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey look for your location.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\nThey look at what you sell.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\nThey look for evidence that you have done this before.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\nThey compare you with someone else.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eFor some businesses, this is where the sale begins.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAnd if there is nothing useful to find, the buyer has to fill in the blanks themselves.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThat is where the problem starts.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eLand \\u0026#x26; property: the buyer is checking before the site visit\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA land buyer has questions before they ever get in the car.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWhere is the company located?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWhat projects have they completed?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWhat properties are available?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWhat do the plots actually look like?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWho else has bought from them?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA strong digital presence cannot replace due diligence. It can, however, make that due diligence easier.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eInstead of sending a buyer through scattered WhatsApp photos, old Facebook posts and forwarded PDFs, you give them somewhere structured to start.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eListings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\nProject history.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\nLocation information.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\nPhotos.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\nEnquiry channels.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe buyer arrives at the phone call with context instead of suspicion.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eMedical equipment: your catalogue is part of the sales process\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA hospital, clinic or procurement team may need to evaluate dozens of products before speaking to a supplier.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey want specifications.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey want product categories.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey want documentation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey want to know who supplies the equipment and whether the company looks established enough to deal with.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf your entire catalogue is a collection of PDFs and WhatsApp attachments, every enquiry starts with someone on your team manually sending information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA structured website changes that.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe buyer can browse the catalogue, understand the products and arrive at the conversation already informed.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eYour sales team stops being a human search engine.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eSchools: the shortlist starts before open day\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eParents don't always begin with a school visit.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey search.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey compare.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey look at the curriculum, facilities, location, admissions process and the overall picture of the institution.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThen they make a shortlist.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eOnly after that comes the visit.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThat means your website is doing something important before the admissions office ever gets the parent's call.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt is answering the first questions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt is setting expectations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt is giving the parent enough confidence to take the next step.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA school website should therefore feel less like an online poster and more like the front office of the institution.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eThe real job of a business website\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA website should not exist because someone said:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\\"Every business needs a website.\\\"\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThat is lazy advice.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe real question is:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhat does a potential customer need to know before they are willing to contact you?\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf the answer includes your services, products, projects, location, credentials, process, pricing information or previous work, that information needs somewhere reliable to live.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eA good website becomes that place.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt can be found through search.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt can be shared directly.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt can answer questions outside business hours.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAnd most importantly, it gives a potential customer something concrete to evaluate.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eThe cure\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWe don't start with a template and ask you what text to put into it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWe start with the buyer.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eFor a property company, that might mean:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSearchable property listings\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eProject and development history\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eLocation and verification information\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eClear enquiry paths\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eFor a medical supplier:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eStructured product catalogues\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eTechnical specifications\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eProduct categories\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eDocumentation and enquiry workflows\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eFor a school:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCurriculum and programmes\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFacilities and school life\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdmissions information\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFees and contact pathways\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eDifferent businesses have different evaluation processes.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe website should be built around yours.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003chr\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf your customers research you before they contact you, your digital presence is already part of your sales process.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe question is whether it is helping you get evaluated — or giving the buyer a reason to move on.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://wa.me/254736194051?text=Hi%20Sonny,%20I%20read%20the%20report%20on%20businesses%20being%20evaluated%20online.%20I%20want%20to%20improve%20how%20my%20business%20is%20presented%20online.\\\"\\u003eBegin the diagnostic\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\nc:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"pt-28 md:pt-32\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"px-6 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-24\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-green\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Web Platforms\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"time\\\",null,{\\\"dateTime\\\":\\\"2026-08-17\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"2026-08-17\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h1\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-6 font-serif font-semibold leading-[1.1] text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.75rem)]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Not Every Business Needs a Website. These Three Can't Afford to Be Invisible.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"figure\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative flex justify-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"absolute -inset-4 bg-green/[0.06] blur-2xl\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dzyxm0rhg/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1786859644/surgical-showroom_d0gdmo.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Not Every Business Needs a Website. These Three Can't Afford to Be Invisible.\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative w-full max-w-sm border border-ink/20 shadow-[0_24px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"figcaption\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Fig. 04 — The evaluation happens online, whether you are there or not.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"journal-body mt-14\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$17\\\"}}],\\\"$L18\\\",\\\"$L19\\\"]}]}]}]\\n1a:I[22016,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$3\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-16 border-t border-ink/10 pt-10\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://wa.me/254736194051?text=Hi%20Sonny,%20I%20just%20read%20the%20journal.%20I%20think%20my%20business%20has%20a%20systems%20problem.\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-ink/30 pb-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors hover:border-green hover:text-green\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Begin the diagnostic\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"width\\\":\\\"11\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"11\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 12 12\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",null,{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M2 10L10 2M10 2H4M10 2V8\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":\\\"1.2\\\"}]}]]}]}]\\n19:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/journal\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-10 inline-block text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"← All field reports\\\"}]\\n12:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"c